# Stage 6 mid layer (factor 8/16, factor_y 0, bottom-aligned, 640x180):
# the Wolfgangsee's south shore seen from the middle of the lake. Far
# limestone peaks f (lit left) / F (shadow, split slanting down-right
# from each apex), h snow only on the highest peak; in front the wooded
# hills v (dominant) with G shadow masses on the right-hand flanks and a
# 2 px v/G checker only along the lit/shadow split; a G tree line at their foot; a few small white
# houses i/m with a d window (Strobl's direction); the B158 as a 1 px m line with a queue
# of tiny cars (R b i) and one yellow Postbus (Y with a d window band,
# 9x4, at x 179: "Bus 150 / im Stau"); a v verge and a G bank (the shore
# line, screen y 90); below it the far lake down to the bottom edge: f
# reflections under the bank, s water with f streaks, longer and further
# apart towards the bottom (mid-layer water rule v G + s/f). Opaque from
# the hill line down. No k, no outlines, no r.
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid is the source.
sprite = bg_suedufer
size   = 640x180
origin = 0,0
anim   = idle frames=1
